 Marina Mall is a 34-minute walk away. The famous Dubai Marina Street overlooking the skyscrapers is a 15-minute drive away. Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are just 22 minutes' drive away. Dubai International Aiport is approximately 35 minutes' drive away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/140/images/2024/04/10/JOrhgfmguOGgIDmOrhKVretAQM9ZsEm5nHgNjGV6.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/10/JOrhgfmguOGgIDmOrhKVretAQM9ZsEm5nHgNjGV6.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/140/images/2024/04/10/Qjj7XjGE5fCdN1vO4qU6lRUpb7GbwHWjYOweSL1T.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/10/Qjj7XjGE5fCdN1vO4qU6lRUpb7GbwHWjYOweSL1T.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/140/images/2024/04/10/S02bQ2gW1wYoPIY3nNTpJLWSgg8xWLLweefZRshQ.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/10/S02bQ2gW1wYoPIY3nNTpJLWSgg8xWLLweefZRshQ.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2843,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2023/06/22/5b9gOEJvQTdhU6nfHYtefopCetiIxcMybj91R1t0.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1093,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1853,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1854,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1855,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"20/80","payment_plans":[{"id":5537,"title":"20%",